                <Title>Spoken-Congolese-French-Dataset</Title>
                <Description>The dataset consists of paired audio and text resources on spoken French from the Republic of the Congo. The audio files were extracted from longer recordings of semi-guided interviews conducted in Brazzaville, and orthographic transcriptions were added. The long audio recordings and their corresponding TRJS transcription files were automatically clipped alongside their respective transcriptions. The dataset comprises ten folders containing audio files and ten audio/text mapping files.</Description>
